      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im kinda freaking out a bit... i keep getting these weird episodes where my head feels really heavy and i get super confused, like i dont know where i am for a sec. and my face feels kind of weird and numb on one side too. i've been super stressed and havent been sleeping, so do u think it's just a massive tension headache or maybe just extreme burnout?",
